     key: &quot;T&quot;
     value {
</code></pre>
<hr />
<p>Context switchs between C++ graph execution and Python eager execution only happens if you explicitly used <a href="https://www.tensorflow.org/api_docs/python/tf/py_function" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><code>tf.py_function</code></a> or <a href="https://www.tensorflow.org/api_docs/python/tf/numpy_function" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><code>tf.numpy_function</code></a>.</p>
<p>Without knowing the specific code you used to reach your conclusion, it's impossible to determine the reason why your training slown down.</p>
